  "assertions": [
    "Public --custody registers one protected GET Observe=0 with the requested Accept option and returns the exact subscription identity",
    "The establishment control result precedes the initial report, and zero report credit emits no report frame",
    "Cumulative acknowledgment zero opens credit for report sequence one; acknowledgment one succeeds only after that complete frame is written",
    "A protected notification emits report sequence two and advances the authenticated OSCORE Observe value by one modulo 2^24",
    "Inline reports carry the exact Message value and five-field metadata projection with the absent Max-Age default of 60",
    "Cancellation sends Observe=1 with the original token, returns null only after the response without Observe and removes the server observer",
    "The seventh ordered SDK patch preserves the response Partial IV used to reconstruct decrypted OSCORE Observe values"
  ],
